                </opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The captain of the port of
                            Funchal to Governor Perdigao</hi>.</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Translation.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Funchal</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1864-02-28"><hi rendition="#italic">February</hi> 28,
                        1864</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Most Excellent Sir</hi>: In compliance with the
                    orders received from your excellency, I have intimated to the commander of the
                    war-steamer Florida to leave this port within twenty-four hours, and in reply to
                    said intimation I have received from said officer a communication, of which I
                    have the honor of transmitting a copy to your excellency, wherein the said
                    commander declares he was forced to come into this port in want of water, bread,
                    and coals, and that consequently it is impossible for him to quit this port
                    without those articles. Your excellency will decide whatever is just, and I
                    await your excellency’s orders on this head. God preserve your excellency.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>JOAQUIN PEDRO DE CASTELBRANCO,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Post-Captain
                            R. N., and Captain of the Port</hi>.</signed>
                </closer>
                <postscript>
                    <p>His Excellency Dn. <hi rendition="#small-caps">Jacintho Antonio
                            Perdigao</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Civil Governor of the Funchal
                            District.</hi></p>
                </postscript>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
